      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. it's a bit of a relief to know voluntary disclosure helps. though it feels a bit like we're playing a game of hide and seek with the tax man, trying to find everything before they do. if we do find these discrepancies, how exactly do we categorize them in the amended filing so they don't look like we were trying to be sneaky?",
